  m_Name: Question 18
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: We connect a high resistance in series with the galvanometer to safeguard
    it from high current.
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: A galvanometer can only measure small currents. Hence we add a
    high resistance in series with it before closing the circuit to safeguard it
    from high current.
